00:39:56.499 --> 00:39:58.900
Uh. scusa. Greg.
Uh. all is good?

1017
00:39:58.934 --> 00:40:00.169
(muffled):
Sí. sí. (grunts)

1018
00:40:00.202 --> 00:40:01.470
(speaks Minionese) ...movies.

1019
00:40:01.504 --> 00:40:03.039
(speaks Minionese) ...Boss.

1020
00:40:03.072 --> 00:40:04.839
-(shouts in Minionese)
-(chanting): Big Boss!

1021
00:40:04.873 --> 00:40:07.043
-Big Boss! Big Boss!
-No. b-buddies.

1022
00:40:07.076 --> 00:40:08.911
Big Boss! Big Boss!

1023
00:40:08.944 --> 00:40:10.379
-Big Boss!
-(door slams shut)

1024
00:40:10.413 --> 00:40:12.415
-(grumbling in Minionese)
-(speaks Minionese) Alles gut?

1025
00:40:12.448 --> 00:40:15.451
(speaking Minionese excitedly)

1026
00:40:15.484 --> 00:40:16.986
(both speaking excitedly)

1027
00:40:17.019 --> 00:40:18.220
(laughing. chattering)

1028
00:40:18.254 --> 00:40:21.157
Come. Ed! ¡Vamos! !Vamos!

1029
00:40:21.190 --> 00:40:24.160
(band playing "Congeroo"
from <i>Hellzapoppin')</i>

1030
00:40:24.193 --> 00:40:25.995
♪ ♪

1031
00:40:26.028 --> 00:40:28.164
(lively chatter)

1032
00:40:28.197 --> 00:40:31.434
MAX: Ooh. there's romance.
(imitates kissing. chuckles)

1033
00:40:31.467 --> 00:40:34.003
How's that going to end up?

1034
00:40:34.036 --> 00:40:36.138
Whoo-hoo-hoo. he's so scary.

1035
00:40:36.172 --> 00:40:39.108
-James. I love your movie.
-Bank you.

1036
00:40:39.141 --> 00:40:42.044
Yes. it's clear
this is a real passion project.

1037
00:40:42.078 --> 00:40:43.346
and you need to make it.

1038
00:40:43.379 --> 00:40:45.214
whatever challenges
get in your way.

1039
00:40:45.247 --> 00:40:47.049
Sí. sí. (speaks Minionese)

1040
00:40:47.083 --> 00:40:48.484
(speaks Minionese) ...advice.

1041
00:40:48.517 --> 00:40:49.884
Advice?

1042
00:40:49.919 --> 00:40:52.421
-Sí. sí. Bitte.
-Uh. well...

1043
00:40:52.455 --> 00:40:53.622
where do I start?

1044
00:40:53.656 --> 00:40:56.625
I mean. eh. uh. yeah.

1045
00:40:56.659 --> 00:40:59.362
Um. you guys have
film equipment?

1046
00:40:59.395 --> 00:41:01.230
Eh... no.

1047
00:41:01.263 --> 00:41:03.332
Ah. no film equipment. Uh-huh.

1048
00:41:03.366 --> 00:41:04.533
A crew?

1049
00:41:04.567 --> 00:41:06.335
(laughs):
Crew. No.

1050
00:41:06.369 --> 00:41:08.204
No crew either? Mm.

1051
00:41:08.237 --> 00:41:12.174
And you wrote a monster movie
with a very big monster?

1052
00:41:12.208 --> 00:41:13.609
Sí. (speaks Minionese) ...kaiju.

1053
00:41:13.642 --> 00:41:15.144
(growling. laughing)

1054
00:41:15.177 --> 00:41:18.214
And what are you going to use
for your monster?

1055
00:41:18.247 --> 00:41:19.982
Ah. uh...

1056
00:41:20.015 --> 00:41:22.218
-(blows raspberry)
-Aha. Okay.

1057
00:41:22.251 --> 00:41:23.252
Listen to me carefully.

1058
00:41:23.285 --> 00:41:25.254
What I'm going to tell you is

1059
00:41:25.287 --> 00:41:27.523
-very. very important.
-(slurping loudly)

1060
00:41:27.556 --> 00:41:29.091
So. if you want

1061
00:41:29.125 --> 00:41:32.528
to make a <i>fantastisch.</i>
very cool monster movie.

1062
00:41:32.561 --> 00:41:35.564
you will need a <i>fantastisch.</i>
very cool monster.

1063
00:41:35.598 --> 00:41:37.500
(sputters. gasps)

1064
00:41:39.602 --> 00:41:42.104
I can't really help you
with that. I'm afraid.

1065
00:41:42.138 --> 00:41:44.673
But I can give you this.

1066
00:41:44.707 --> 00:41:47.376
♪ ♪

1067
00:41:49.478 --> 00:41:51.414
JAMES:
Un-un-un cámara.

1068
00:41:51.447 --> 00:41:53.682
Max. wirklich?

1069
00:41:53.716 --> 00:41:55.951
It was a gift from my father.

1070
00:41:55.985 --> 00:41:57.420
My first camera.

1071
00:41:58.554 --> 00:42:01.123
I'm passing it on to you now.

1072
00:42:01.157 --> 00:42:03.559
I believe in you. James.

1073
00:42:03.592 --> 00:42:05.961
I know you'll do great.

1074
00:42:05.995 --> 00:42:09.131
And remember.
a very cool monster movie

1075
00:42:09.165 --> 00:42:11.300
needs a very cool monster.

1076
00:42:11.333 --> 00:42:13.736
WOMAN:
Max. darling. Come over here.

1077
00:42:13.769 --> 00:42:15.938
Good luck. guys.

1078
00:42:19.508 --> 00:42:20.576
(sighs heavily)

1079
00:42:20.609 --> 00:42:22.578
(speaks Minionese) ...kaiju.

1080
00:42:22.611 --> 00:42:24.547
-(yelps) Uh...
-Ed.

1081
00:42:24.580 --> 00:42:26.248
(rummaging)

1082
00:42:28.784 --> 00:42:30.085
(gasps)

1083
00:42:30.119 --> 00:42:32.321
♪ ♪

1084
00:42:33.422 --> 00:42:34.623
-Oh...
-(gasps)

1085
00:42:34.657 --> 00:42:36.559
-Hey. buddies. buddies.
-Sí.

1086
00:42:36.592 --> 00:42:38.060
Maka la movie!

1087
00:42:38.093 --> 00:42:40.095
(laughing)

1088
00:42:40.129 --> 00:42:41.464
(blathering happily)

1089
00:42:41.497 --> 00:42:43.199
Ed saved the day!

1090
00:42:43.232 --> 00:42:44.767
James is gonna get his monster!

1091
00:42:44.800 --> 00:42:47.203
Oh. well.
I'm happy you're happy.

1092
00:42:47.236 --> 00:42:48.504
(Olivia laughs)

1093
00:42:48.537 --> 00:42:50.172
Now do you mind if I go on
with the story?

1094
00:42:50.206 --> 00:42:52.575
Sorry. I get
a little excited sometimes.

1095
00:42:52.608 --> 00:42:54.376
Yes! Please continue.

1096
00:42:54.410 --> 00:42:56.545
What about Dick
and the other Minions?

1097
00:42:56.579 --> 00:42:58.180
Did they find a new boss?

1098
00:42:58.214 --> 00:43:00.749
Ooh. yes. well.
I was getting to it.

1099
00:43:00.783 --> 00:43:04.186
Dick and his friends were
about to fulfill the mission

1100
00:43:04.220 --> 00:43:07.490
of every Minion ever
and find their tribe

1101
00:43:07.523 --> 00:43:11.126
the greatest.
most evil master to serve.

1102
00:43:11.160 --> 00:43:13.462
(chanting):
Big Boss! Big Boss!

1103
00:43:13.496 --> 00:43:17.266
Big Boss! Big Boss!
Big Boss! Big Boss!

1104
00:43:17.299 --> 00:43:18.767
-(robotic voice): Attention.
-(shushing)

1105
00:43:18.801 --> 00:43:21.203
Uh. attention. earthlings.

1106
00:43:21.237 --> 00:43:24.039
Cease current activities
and listen.

1107
00:43:24.073 --> 00:43:25.474
(speaks Minionese)

1108
00:43:26.475 --> 00:43:28.244
I am Dort.

1109
00:43:28.277 --> 00:43:31.113
and I was sent here
by the Supreme High Ruler

1110
00:43:31.146 --> 00:43:34.083
to judge this pathetic planet.

1111
00:43:34.116 --> 00:43:35.484
(gasps)

1112
00:43:35.518 --> 00:43:37.386
Big Boss?

1113
00:43:37.419 --> 00:43:41.190
But first. uh. Dort needs
to find loyal assistants.

1114
00:43:41.223 --> 00:43:43.392
Ooh. hey. you.
with the very cool spaceship.

1115
00:43:43.425 --> 00:43:45.294
-(gasps)
-Do you want to serve Dort?

1116
00:43:45.327 --> 00:43:46.762
-Okay. let's go home.
-(imitates flying saucer)

1117
00:43:46.795 --> 00:43:49.465
You can do this kind of thing
on your mom's weekend.

1118
00:43:49.498 --> 00:43:51.166
Oh. yes. and...

1119
00:43:51.200 --> 00:43:53.302
-(men laughing)
-MAN: Come on. please.

1120
00:43:53.335 --> 00:43:54.837
-Leave me alone. (yelps)
-(laughter)

1121
00:43:54.870 --> 00:43:57.106
Guys. look at this winner.

1122
00:43:57.139 --> 00:43:58.374
DORT:
Ah. thank you.

1123
00:43:58.407 --> 00:44:00.109
That's very kind.
(clears throat)

1124
00:44:00.142 --> 00:44:03.379
Are you and your burly friends
interested in assisting Dort

1125
00:44:03.412 --> 00:44:05.447
in a potentially
dangerous mission?

1126
00:44:05.481 --> 00:44:07.683
Hey. I think the weirdo
in the lame robot suit

1127
00:44:07.716 --> 00:44:09.218
is talking to us.

1128
00:44:09.251 --> 00:44:12.421
Ha. I can assure you
that this is no costume.

1129
00:44:12.454 --> 00:44:13.289
Um. I mean...

1130
00:44:13.322 --> 00:44:15.291
You know. it's dangerous
to hang out here

1131
00:44:15.324 --> 00:44:16.825
dressed as a tin can.

1132
00:44:16.859 --> 00:44:18.260
(raucous laughter)

1133
00:44:18.294 --> 00:44:19.728
(Dort laughing mockingly)

1134
00:44:19.762 --> 00:44:22.164
Ah. ha-ha-ha. Ha. ha-ha-ha.

1135
00:44:22.197 --> 00:44:26.135
A tin can wishes it were
as tough as me. so there.

1136
00:44:26.168 --> 00:44:27.703
-(men growling)
-(knuckles cracking)

1137
00:44:27.736 --> 00:44:30.573
(clears throat) I sense you are
preparing a hostile attack.

1138
00:44:30.606 --> 00:44:31.807
Please stop.

1139
00:44:31.840 --> 00:44:33.709
Oh. yeah? Or what?

1140
00:44:33.742 --> 00:44:35.444
(Dort groans)

1141
00:44:35.477 --> 00:44:36.845
(man screams)

1142
00:44:36.879 --> 00:44:38.213
(thuds)

1143
00:44:38.247 --> 00:44:39.448
(high-pitched yelp)

1144
00:44:39.481 --> 00:44:40.716
Whoa.

1145
00:44:40.749 --> 00:44:42.718
Why. you!

1146
00:44:42.751 --> 00:44:44.420
-(grunts)
-(metallic clang)

1147
00:44:45.220 --> 00:44:47.356
(screaming)

1148
00:44:47.389 --> 00:44:49.525
-(whimpering)
-(scoffs) Now you've done it.

1149
00:44:49.558 --> 00:44:51.860
Dort was on a simple mission...

1150
00:44:51.894 --> 00:44:53.462
-(growling)
-(grunting)

1151
00:44:53.495 --> 00:44:57.232
...to decide whether or not
Earth should be invaded.

1152
00:44:57.266 --> 00:44:59.368
and then you went and got all up

1153
00:44:59.401 --> 00:45:01.870
in Dort's
facial recognition sensors.

1154
00:45:01.905 --> 00:45:03.405
Dort has made his decision

1155
00:45:03.439 --> 00:45:05.641
regarding the fate
of this planet.

1156
00:45:05.674 --> 00:45:06.842
(gasping in awe)

1157
00:45:06.875 --> 00:45:09.311
Dort is going to invade Earth

1158
00:45:09.345 --> 00:45:12.748
and enslave humanity!

1159
00:45:12.781 --> 00:45:16.251
(laughs) Hey. hey. scusa. scusa.

1160
00:45:16.885 --> 00:45:18.354
Ah. greetings.

1161
00:45:18.387 --> 00:45:19.923
-I am Dort.
-(stammers)

1162
00:45:19.956 --> 00:45:21.657
Bello. Dort. Soy Dick.

1163
00:45:21.690 --> 00:45:23.626
Salutations. Richard.

1164
00:45:23.659 --> 00:45:25.594
Bah. no. no. no. Le Dick.

1165
00:45:25.628 --> 00:45:26.862
Mm. okay.

1166
00:45:26.895 --> 00:45:31.567
Do you want to assist Dort in
a potentially dangerous mission?

1167
00:45:31.600 --> 00:45:34.503
-Sí. Sí. sí! Yeah!
-MINIONS: Sí! (cheering)

1168
00:45:34.536 --> 00:45:37.907
Great! Follow Dort back
to Dort's secret lair!

1169
00:45:37.941 --> 00:45:39.808
(yells. laughs)

1170
00:45:39.842 --> 00:45:41.443
DICK:
Big Boss!

1171
00:45:41.477 --> 00:45:44.413
MINIONS (chanting):
Big Boss! Big Boss! Big Boss!

1172
00:45:46.950 --> 00:45:48.283
(sighs) Okay.

1173
00:45:48.317 --> 00:45:49.785
(speaks Minionese)

1174
00:45:49.818 --> 00:45:51.253
-Henry?
-Sí. sí.

1175
00:45:51.286 --> 00:45:53.322
Ed? ¡Vamos!

1176
00:45:53.355 --> 00:45:55.190
(clears throat)

1177
00:45:55.224 --> 00:45:57.493
Miso soup... (speaks Minionese)

1178
00:45:57.526 --> 00:45:59.662
...yaki onigiri...
(speaks Minionese)

1179
00:45:59.695 --> 00:46:01.363
...edamame...

1180
00:46:01.397 --> 00:46:02.966
(speaks Minionese)

1181
00:46:02.999 --> 00:46:04.800
...daifuku!

1182
00:46:04.833 --> 00:46:06.268
(crackling)

1183
00:46:06.301 --> 00:46:07.870
(creature snarling)

1184
00:46:07.904 --> 00:46:09.438
(wind whistling)

1185
00:46:10.239 --> 00:46:12.441
-(gasps) Looka!
-(Henry whimpers)

1186
00:46:12.474 --> 00:46:14.309
(creature snarling fiercely)

1187
00:46:14.343 --> 00:46:16.445
(crackling)

1188
00:46:19.815 --> 00:46:22.418
(fierce snarling continues)

1189
00:46:23.053 --> 00:46:25.287
HENRY and JAMES:
Le kaiju! (laughing)

1190
00:46:28.290 --> 00:46:30.426
(laughing giddily)

1191
00:46:30.459 --> 00:46:31.860
Yes! Yes. I'm free!

1192
00:46:31.894 --> 00:46:34.430
F-F-Freedom. (giggling)

1193
00:46:34.463 --> 00:46:35.864
-(giggling continues)
-Bah...

1194
00:46:35.898 --> 00:46:37.967
-Oh. happy day!
-Hmm?

1195
00:46:38.001 --> 00:46:42.838
Oh. I got to say. it is
so great to finally be out.

1196
00:46:42.871 --> 00:46:46.275
I have been trapped
in that book forever. and I...

1197
00:46:46.308 --> 00:46:47.476
-(squeaks)
-(speaks Minionese) ...monstra.

1198
00:46:47.509 --> 00:46:49.278
-I am forever in your debt.
-Hmm.

1199
00:46:49.311 --> 00:46:50.579
-And I just wanted to-- Whoa!
-(squeaking)

1200
00:46:50.612 --> 00:46:51.981
What you doing there. mister?

1201
00:46:52.015 --> 00:46:53.582
-(squeaking)
-Whoo. (laughing)

1202
00:46:53.615 --> 00:46:55.417
-(squeaking rapidly)
-Oh. whoo. whoo. okay. okay.

1203
00:46:55.451 --> 00:46:57.419
-(squeaking continues)
-Henry. no. no. no. no.

1204
00:46:57.453 --> 00:47:00.924
-(sighs. speaking Minionese)
-(laughs. whoops)

1205
00:47:00.957 --> 00:47:02.558
(speaks Minionese)

1206
00:47:02.591 --> 00:47:05.894
Oh. no. I feel like I've
disappointed you in some way.

1207
00:47:05.929 --> 00:47:08.031
I'm-I'm so sorry. Can I help?

1208
00:47:08.064 --> 00:47:10.265
(speaks Minionese)
...le monstras?

1209
00:47:10.299 --> 00:47:13.036
Monsters?
You want big. scary monsters?

1210
00:47:13.069 --> 00:47:15.871
(laughs)
Sí. Come here. come here.

1211
00:47:15.905 --> 00:47:17.372
(grunts)

1212
00:47:17.406 --> 00:47:18.942
Que para le movies.

1213
00:47:18.975 --> 00:47:20.442
(chuckles):
Oh.

1214
00:47:20.476 --> 00:47:23.512
You need monsters
for your movie.

1215
00:47:23.545 --> 00:47:26.381
I know the perfect monsters
for you.

1216
00:47:26.415 --> 00:47:27.683
I'll take you to 'em.

1217
00:47:27.716 --> 00:47:29.818
-(gasps) Uh. uh. bank you!
-(Henry gasps)

1218
00:47:29.852 --> 00:47:31.453
Oh. by the way.

1219
00:47:31.487 --> 00:47:34.356
I'm Gary Orkam Oliver
Magma Ichabod the Deceiver.

1220
00:47:34.389 --> 00:47:36.725
But my friends just call me
Goomi for short.

1221
00:47:36.759 --> 00:47:38.293
Oh. Soy James.

1222
00:47:38.327 --> 00:47:39.895
Oh. James.

1223
00:47:39.929 --> 00:47:41.897
Rolls off the face tendrils.

1224
00:47:41.931 --> 00:47:43.398
James. (burbling)

1225
00:47:43.432 --> 00:47:45.367
-(speaks Minionese) ...Henry.
-Hey. bello.

1226
00:47:45.400 --> 00:47:47.336
Henry. Oh. I like it.

1227
00:47:47.369 --> 00:47:48.737
It sounds tough and rugged.

1228
00:47:48.771 --> 00:47:50.572
It's like.
"Oh. look out. here comes

1229
00:47:50.606 --> 00:47:51.840
(gruff voice):
Henry!"

1230
00:47:51.874 --> 00:47:53.342
(speaks Minionese) ...Ed.

1231
00:47:53.375 --> 00:47:55.477
Ed. <i>Enchanté.</i>

1232
00:47:56.678 --> 00:47:58.714
Oh. man.
it's gonna be so much fun!

1233
00:47:58.747 --> 00:47:59.983
Come on. come on!

1234
00:48:00.016 --> 00:48:01.918
-(James laughing) -HENRY: Huh?
-GOOMI: What a fantastic day!

1235
00:48:01.951 --> 00:48:03.685
(stammers) No.

1236
00:48:03.719 --> 00:48:05.287
(Henry whimpers)

1237
00:48:05.955 --> 00:48:07.556
Wipe your insolent feet

1238
00:48:07.589 --> 00:48:11.060
before stepping into
the lair of Dort.

1239
00:48:11.094 --> 00:48:13.395
(water dripping)

1240
00:48:13.428 --> 00:48:14.530
DICK:
Uh...

1241
00:48:14.563 --> 00:48:16.598
(speaks Minionese) ...le lair?

1242
00:48:16.632 --> 00:48:17.934
DORT:
Affirmative.

1243
00:48:17.967 --> 00:48:19.936
Everyone. file in.

1244
00:48:19.969 --> 00:48:21.470
WOMAN:
Dort!

1245
00:48:21.503 --> 00:48:22.738
Where have you been?

1246
00:48:22.771 --> 00:48:24.073
-(cat screeching)
-(Minions whimpering)

1247
00:48:24.107 --> 00:48:25.942
Ah. Mrs. Konikoff.

1248
00:48:25.975 --> 00:48:27.543
Yes. so sorry.

1249
00:48:27.576 --> 00:48:29.979
Uh. Dort had
an important work meeting.

1250
00:48:30.013 --> 00:48:32.447
But I come with good news.

1251
00:48:32.481 --> 00:48:34.550
Look what I found
on my way back.

1252
00:48:34.583 --> 00:48:36.685
-Those muffins you love.
-(growling)

1253
00:48:36.718 --> 00:48:39.521
I only like the blueberry ones!

1254
00:48:39.555 --> 00:48:41.456
DORT:
Yes. you're in luck.

1255
00:48:42.058 --> 00:48:45.094
(growls) And I can only eat them
with a glass of...

1256
00:48:45.128 --> 00:48:46.829
Milk?

1257
00:48:46.862 --> 00:48:48.430
(Mrs. Konikoff grumbling)

1258
00:48:48.463 --> 00:48:51.867
Enjoy your fruit-filled
baked goods.

1259
00:48:51.900 --> 00:48:53.102
(sighs contentedly)

1260
00:48:53.136 --> 00:48:55.071
What a sweet. sweet.
lovely woman.

1261
00:48:55.104 --> 00:48:57.773
She shall be spared
when Dort overthrows the planet.

1262
00:48:57.806 --> 00:48:59.708
