1544
01:00:20.789 --> 01:00:22.825
(grunts)

1545
01:00:22.858 --> 01:00:24.460
(Goomi laughing)

1546
01:00:24.493 --> 01:00:28.097
Holy!
Wow. would you look at this!

1547
01:00:28.130 --> 01:00:29.365
(laughing)

1548
01:00:29.398 --> 01:00:31.133
(speaking Minionese excitedly)

1549
01:00:31.166 --> 01:00:32.334
Uh. uh.

1550
01:00:32.368 --> 01:00:34.570
(muttering quietly in Minionese)

1551
01:00:36.872 --> 01:00:38.641
-Uh...
-Oh! Oh. oh. oh. look.

1552
01:00:38.674 --> 01:00:40.276
-This is great.
-Huh?

1553
01:00:40.309 --> 01:00:41.277
Sí.

1554
01:00:41.310 --> 01:00:43.779
(speaking Minionese excitedly)

1555
01:00:43.812 --> 01:00:46.148
(growls)
El a destructo la terra!

1556
01:00:46.181 --> 01:00:47.683
(laughing giddily)
C'est besta storya.

1557
01:00:47.716 --> 01:00:50.853
Oh. James. you've painted
such a wonderful picture

1558
01:00:50.886 --> 01:00:53.088
