moment. please.

1569
01:01:14.743 --> 01:01:15.844
(laughs nervously)

1570
01:01:15.878 --> 01:01:17.846
Uh. you and you. a word?
(chuckles)

1571
01:01:17.880 --> 01:01:19.782
We'll be right back.

1572
01:01:19.815 --> 01:01:22.418
Oh. Okay.

1573
01:01:22.451 --> 01:01:24.386
(laughing)

1574
01:01:24.420 --> 01:01:26.188
(grunts)

1575
01:01:26.221 --> 01:01:28.290
Uh. Eh.

1576
01:01:29.425 --> 01:01:31.260
