1583
01:01:45.240 --> 01:01:46.442
You've changed. man.

1584
01:01:46.475 --> 01:01:48.544
-Howard agree!
-Guys. guys. guys.

1585
01:01:48.577 --> 01:01:49.745
Where's the trust?

1586
01:01:49.778 --> 01:01:52.381
Of course we're gonna
destroy everything.

1587
01:01:52.414 --> 01:01:54.216
When those cameras
start rolling.

1588
01:01:54.249 --> 01:01:56.885
we're going to conjure Irene.

1589
01:01:56.920 --> 01:01:58.754
-Irene?!
-Irene?! Really?

1590
01:01:58.787 --> 01:02:02.358
Yes. Irene.
the eater of worlds herself.

1591
01:02:02.391 --> 01:02:03.726
We're gonna have our revenge.

1592
01:02:03.759 --> 01:02:07.229
but we're gonna destroy
everything on the planet.

1593
01:02:07.262 --> 01:02:09.698
-Destroy! (laughing maniacally)
-(door opens)

1594
01:02:09.732 --> 01:02:12.601
-Howard. stop!
-Huh?

1595
01:02:13.937 --> 01:02:16.505
Uh... destroy?

1596
01:02:16.538 --> 01:02:19.208
(laughs):
Oh. hey. Henry. buddy.

1597
01:02:20.509 --> 01:02:22.378
James!

1598
01:02:22.411 --> 01:02:24.948
-(yelps. whimpers)
-Get him!

1599
01:02:24.981 --> 01:02:27.616
(panicked whimpering. panting)

1600
01:02:27.650 --> 01:02:29.251
(shrieks)

1601
01:02:29.919 --> 01:02:31.253
-(roaring)
-(gasping)

1602
01:02:31.286 --> 01:02:33.455
-(growling)
-Uh...

1603
01:02:33.489 --> 01:02:35.224
-(gasps) Ooh!
-(Henry laughs)

1604
01:02:35.257 --> 01:02:37.426
("The Lone Ranger" playing
at fast speed)

1605
01:02:39.261 --> 01:02:41.430
-(sped-up audio)
-(Howard yelling)

1606
01:02:43.799 --> 01:02:45.901
-(metallic clang) -Ow!
-(high-pitched laughter)

1607
01:02:45.935 --> 01:02:47.670
(roaring)

1608
01:02:47.703 --> 01:02:49.271
(Howard growling)

1609
01:02:49.304 --> 01:02:51.306
-(Phillips grunting)
-HENRY: Hmm.

1610
01:02:51.340 --> 01:02:52.942
PHILLIPS:
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

1611
01:02:52.976 --> 01:02:54.877
-(grunting. yelping)
-(Henry giggling)

1612
01:02:54.911 --> 01:02:56.478
-Hey!
-(blows raspberries)

1613
01:02:56.512 --> 01:02:57.947
-(laughing)
-(growling)

1614
01:02:57.981 --> 01:03:00.315
Eh. en garde!
(speaking Minionese)

1615
01:03:01.750 --> 01:03:04.687
HOWARD: Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
(screams)

1616
01:03:04.720 --> 01:03:06.555
(Henry laughing)

1617
01:03:07.756 --> 01:03:09.258
Aha!

1618
01:03:09.291 --> 01:03:10.559
(screaming)

1619
01:03:10.592 --> 01:03:12.294
-(blowing)
-(laughing)

1620
01:03:12.327 --> 01:03:13.562
(exclaims)

1621
01:03:13.595 --> 01:03:14.730
-(song ends)
-(normal audio resumes)

1622
01:03:14.763 --> 01:03:16.598
-(muffled grunting)
-(deep laughter)

1623
01:03:16.632 --> 01:03:17.666
James!

1624
01:03:17.700 --> 01:03:20.269
Huh? Henry?

1625
01:03:20.302 --> 01:03:21.437
-(muffled shouting)
-JAMES: Henry?!

1626
01:03:21.470 --> 01:03:23.338
Oh. hide him. Hide him. quick.

1627
01:03:23.372 --> 01:03:25.407
Henry? (gasps)

1628
01:03:25.441 --> 01:03:28.343
Oh. hi. James. Mm. no.

1629
01:03:28.377 --> 01:03:29.578
-There's no Henry here.
-(muffled shouting)

1630
01:03:29.611 --> 01:03:32.314
Uh. just us monsters. you know.

1631
01:03:32.347 --> 01:03:33.882
talking about. uh...

1632
01:03:33.917 --> 01:03:39.254
uh. a friend of ours that would
be great in your movie.

1633
01:03:40.723 --> 01:03:41.790
(sighs wistfully)

1634
01:03:41.824 --> 01:03:43.726
This is Irene.

1635
01:03:43.759 --> 01:03:44.827
JAMES:
Oh.

1636
01:03:44.860 --> 01:03:49.832
Imagine the movie opens
with Irene being conjured.

1637
01:03:49.865 --> 01:03:51.734
The coolest monster ever.

1638
01:03:51.767 --> 01:03:55.270
unleashed upon
an unsuspecting world.

1639
01:03:55.304 --> 01:03:56.605
Oh. I promise you. James.

1640
01:03:56.638 --> 01:03:58.975
you've never seen
a monster like her.

1641
01:03:59.008 --> 01:04:01.810
Okay. ¡Vamos. vamos!

1642
01:04:01.844 --> 01:04:04.246
