and also that the scene
we're about to do. you know.

1653
01:04:42.751 --> 01:04:45.521
when Irene arrives. he thinks
it's missing something.

1654
01:04:45.554 --> 01:04:48.457
-Huh? (speaks Minionese)
-Yeah. yeah. yeah. exactly.

1655
01:04:48.490 --> 01:04:50.659
But Henry had a solution.

1656
01:04:50.692 --> 01:04:52.962
What if. when the monster
first comes out.

1657
01:04:52.996 --> 01:04:54.663
