of the first sacrifice!

1661
01:05:04.506 --> 01:05:06.542
(muffled pleading)

1662
01:05:06.575 --> 01:05:08.544
(gasps. laughs) Henry! Bank you!

1663
01:05:08.577 --> 01:05:10.412
(muffled):
Mm-mm. mm-mm!

1664
01:05:10.445 --> 01:05:12.447
GOOMI:
Oh. man. he seems excited. huh?

1665
01:05:12.481 --> 01:05:14.783
-He's really getting
into the part. -Aw.

1666
01:05:14.817 --> 01:05:16.852
(sighs) Well. James.

1667
01:05:16.885 --> 01:05:18.554
Jim. Jimmy.

1668
01:05:18.587 --> 01:05:19.923
-Jimothy.
-(yelps)

1669
01:05:19.956 --> 01:05:23.792
Are you ready to start making
your first movie?

1670
01:05:23.826 --> 01:05:25.028
Sí. sí. (laughing)

1671
01:05:25.061 --> 01:05:28.363
By the way. are you okay with
me appearing in this scene?

1672
01:05:28.397 --> 01:05:29.565
Th-This is your project.

1673
01:05:29.598 --> 01:05:30.899
I don't want
to step on any toes.

1674
01:05:30.934 --> 01:05:33.502
No problemo. Lumiosa!

1675
01:05:34.670 --> 01:05:35.537
Sonos!

1676
01:05:35.571 --> 01:05:36.906
