1677
01:05:36.940 --> 01:05:38.440
Y smoka!

1678
01:05:38.473 --> 01:05:40.642
<i>Minions y Monstras.</i>

1679
01:05:40.676 --> 01:05:41.911
Uno!

1680
01:05:41.945 --> 01:05:44.346
♪ ♪

1681
01:05:45.581 --> 01:05:47.116
(Goomi laughing maniacally)

1682
01:05:47.150 --> 01:05:50.385
The end is finally here.

1683
01:05:50.419 --> 01:05:53.455
Earth is living
its last moments.

1684
01:05:53.488 --> 01:05:55.858
The monsters are back

1685
01:05:55.891 --> 01:05:58.527
