-(thunder cracking)

1686
01:05:58.560 --> 01:06:04.466
The time for Irene
has come again!

1687
01:06:04.499 --> 01:06:06.002
Rahlia!

1688
01:06:06.035 --> 01:06:08.570
-Yogsogoth!
-(soft whooshing)

1689
01:06:09.239 --> 01:06:11.140
-Flitahgen!
-(crackling)

1690
01:06:11.174 --> 01:06:13.910
-Carbonica!
-(whooshing)

1691
01:06:13.943 --> 01:06:17.512
Alea Iacta Est!

1692
01:06:18.047 --> 01:06:21.884
Mercurio Sulubidis!

1693
01:06:23.619 --> 01:06:27.924
Cardamen Macchiato!

1694
01:06:33.462 --> 01:06:35.664
♪ ♪

1695
01:06:39.102 --> 01:06:40.769
(exclaims)

1696
01:06:40.802 --> 01:06:45.041
Welcome. the all-consuming.

1697
01:06:45.074 --> 01:06:48.011
all-powerful Irene!

1698
01:06:48.044 --> 01:06:49.745
(low growl)

1699
01:06:49.778 --> 01:06:51.580
(thuds)

1700
01:06:51.613 --> 01:06:54.217
