1701
01:06:54.250 --> 01:06:55.919
PHILLIPS:
Irene!

1702
01:06:55.952 --> 01:06:57.519
(gasps. exhales)

1703
01:06:57.552 --> 01:07:00.089
Wow. you're so beautiful!

1704
01:07:00.123 --> 01:07:03.192
So big. so orange. so...

1705
01:07:03.226 --> 01:07:06.795
G-G-Gooey!

1706
01:07:06.828 --> 01:07:09.065
Now feed. Irene!

1707
01:07:09.098 --> 01:07:12.101
Feast on our modest offering

1708
01:07:12.135 --> 01:07:14.903
