1710
01:07:16.505 --> 01:07:17.806
(muffled shouting)

1711
01:07:17.839 --> 01:07:20.143
(low growl)

1712
01:07:20.176 --> 01:07:22.744
(muffled shouting continues)

1713
01:07:22.778 --> 01:07:24.948
C'est gooda! Gooda. Henry!

1714
01:07:24.981 --> 01:07:26.782
(strained grunting)

1715
01:07:27.616 --> 01:07:30.086
(yelling. grunting)

1716
