(exclaims)

1719
01:07:37.026 --> 01:07:39.228
(panting. whimpering)

1720
01:07:39.262 --> 01:07:40.829
(screams)

1721
01:07:45.168 --> 01:07:46.970
(grunting)

1722
01:07:47.003 --> 01:07:48.104
(panting)

1723
