James! Helpa me!

1724
01:07:50.006 --> 01:07:51.640
Huh? Helpa?

1725
01:07:51.673 --> 01:07:53.209
But por qué helpa?

1726
01:07:53.242 --> 01:07:54.776
-(Irene bellowing)
-(screams)

1727
01:07:57.914 --> 01:07:59.881
(grunting) James!

1728
01:07:59.916 --> 01:08:01.184
Uh. no. no!

1729
01:08:01.217 --> 01:08:02.617
Stoppa!

1730
01:08:02.651 --> 01:08:04.220
Irene. stoppa!

1731
01:08:04.253 --> 01:08:06.588
Bitte. bitte. stoppa!

1732
01:08:06.621 --> 01:08:09.092
GOOMI:
Stop? I'm not gonna stop.

1733
01:08:09.125 --> 01:08:11.727
I've been waiting
for this moment for eons.

1734
01:08:11.760 --> 01:08:15.731
Irene is going to devour
everything and everyone.

1735
01:08:15.764 --> 01:08:17.266
No!

1736
01:08:17.300 --> 01:08:19.002
-(low roaring)
-(whimpering)

1737
01:08:19.035 --> 01:08:21.070
(panting)

1738
01:08:21.104 --> 01:08:23.505
No. no. no. no. no. no. no!

1739
01:08:26.209 --> 01:08:28.777
Henry! Oh. oh. no!

1740
01:08:32.115 --> 01:08:33.615
(gasping)

1741
01:08:33.648 --> 01:08:36.119
(screaming. yelling)

1742
01:08:42.824 --> 01:08:44.994
(panicked screaming)

1743
01:08:45.827 --> 01:08:48.663
-(panicked screaming continues)
-(horns honking)

1744
01:08:48.697 --> 01:08:50.632
(panting. whimpering)

1745
01:08:52.667 --> 01:08:53.902
(whistles)

1746
01:08:55.171 --> 01:08:57.040
(panicked screaming. shouting)

1747
01:08:57.073 --> 01:08:58.673
Henry! Uh...

1748
01:08:59.976 --> 01:09:01.277
(yells. whimpers)

1749
01:09:01.310 --> 01:09:02.644
(growls)

1750
01:09:02.677 --> 01:09:03.980
(grunting rhythmically)

1751
01:09:04.013 --> 01:09:05.114
(dog barks)

1752
01:09:05.148 --> 01:09:06.349
(woman screams)

1753
01:09:06.382 --> 01:09:08.217
(Debbie sighs contentedly)

1754
01:09:08.251 --> 01:09:09.919
That was super fun.

1755
01:09:09.952 --> 01:09:12.754
What a perfect day
this has been.

1756
01:09:12.788 --> 01:09:14.157
Thank you so much.

1757
01:09:14.190 --> 01:09:16.192
Oh. Oh. no.

1758
01:09:16.225 --> 01:09:18.693
No. no. No. Thank you.

1759
01:09:18.727 --> 01:09:20.762
I really like you. Dort.
You're...

1760
01:09:20.796 --> 01:09:23.299
you're not like
the other men that I know.

1761
01:09:23.332 --> 01:09:27.203
Mm. You mean Dort is not
all about suppressing feelings

1762
01:09:27.236 --> 01:09:29.372
