1763
01:09:29.405 --> 01:09:32.308
Well. yes. but more like.
with you...

1764
01:09:32.341 --> 01:09:36.012
well. I-I feel respected
and listened to.

1765
01:09:36.045 --> 01:09:38.647
Aw. Debbie.

1766
01:09:38.680 --> 01:09:40.582
Dort.

1767
01:09:41.284 --> 01:09:43.685
♪ ♪

1768
01:09:45.154 --> 01:09:46.355
(whooshing)

1769
01:09:46.389 --> 01:09:48.091
-(crashing)
-(gasps)

1770
01:09:48.124 --> 01:09:50.159
(panicked screaming)

1771
01:09:52.995 --> 01:09:54.097
(gasps)

1772
01:09:54.130 --> 01:09:55.697
(speaks Minionese. gasps)

1773
01:09:55.730 --> 01:09:58.101
(Henry screaming)

1774
01:09:58.134 --> 01:10:00.702
